#: includes/class-admin.php:32 includes/class-admin.php:33
#: includes/class-admin.php:85
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Configuració"

#: includes/class-admin.php:87
msgid "How to set up GoatCounter"
msgstr "Com configurar GoatCounter"

#: includes/class-admin.php:89
msgid ""
"Create a free account at <a href=\"https://www.goatcounter.com\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">goatcounter.com</a> or install "
"GoatCounter on your own server."
msgstr ""
"Crea un compte gratuït a <a href=\"https://www.goatcounter.com\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">goatcounter.com</a> o instal·la "
"GoatCounter al teu propi servidor."

#: includes/class-admin.php:90
msgid ""
"Your site code is the subdomain of your dashboard URL. Example: if your URL "
"is <code>mysite.goatcounter.com</code>, your site code is <code>mysite</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"El codi del lloc és el subdomini de la teva URL del tauler. Exemple: si la "
"URL és <code>mysite.goatcounter.com</code>, el codi és <code>mysite</code>."

#: includes/class-admin.php:91
msgid ""
"Get your API token at <strong>Settings → API</strong> in your GoatCounter "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Obtén el token de l'API a <strong>Configuració → API</strong> del tauler de "
"GoatCounter."

#: includes/class-admin.php:92
msgid ""
"If you use a self-hosted instance, enter the full URL (with https://) in the "
"self-hosted URL field below."
msgstr ""
"Si uses una instal·lació pròpia, introdueix la URL completa (amb https://) "
"al camp «URL auto-allotjada»."

#: includes/class-admin.php:93
msgid "Paste both values below and save."
msgstr "Enganxa els valors aquí sota i desa."

#: includes/class-admin.php:100
msgid "Site code"
msgstr "Codi del lloc"

#: includes/class-admin.php:108
msgid "Self-hosted URL"
msgstr "URL auto-allotjada"

#: includes/class-admin.php:113
msgid ""
"Leave blank if you use hosted GoatCounter (goatcounter.com). If you use a "
"self-hosted instance, enter the full URL (e.g. <code>https://"
"stats.example.com</code>)."
msgstr ""
"Deixa en blanc si uses GoatCounter allotjat (goatcounter.com). Si uses una "
"instal·lació pròpia, posa la URL completa (ex.: <code>https://"
"estadistiques.exemple.cat</code>)."

#: includes/class-admin.php:117
msgid "API token"
msgstr "Token de l'API"

#: includes/class-admin.php:125
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "Desa la configuració"

#: includes/class-admin.php:137
#, php-format
msgid ""
"⚙️ Configure your GoatCounter site code and API token in <a "
"href=\"%s\">Settings</a>."
msgstr ""
"⚙️ Configura el codi del lloc i el token de l'API a <a "
"href=\"%s\">Configuració</a>."

